verses.t:
Nuko ababazwe bose bo mu Bisirayeli nk'uko amazu ya ba sekuru ari,
                bamaze imyaka makumyabiri bavutse cyangwa isāga, abo mu Bisirayeli babasha gutabara
                bose;

kandi umeze nk'ishashi yamenyereye kugishira mu butayu, irehera mu
                muyaga yarinze. Ni nde wabasha kuyirindura yarinze? Abamushaka ntibazananirwa;
                bazamubona ukwezi kwe kubonetse.
